openulla

Purpose: interoperability. This project documents how the ULLA link of AirPods
Pro 2 (USB-C) works so that independently created programs and devices can
interoperate with them. The findings are published only to the extent needed
for that purpose.

Method: analysis of publicly available material (FCC certification exhibits,
Apple patents, the AirPods firmware as published by Apple on its public asset
server) and measurements on our own devices.

What this repository contains: descriptions written by its authors, short
quotations with their sources named, metadata about public files, and the
authors' own tools. It does not contain Apple firmware, extracts of it,
decompiled or disassembled code, or copies of the FCC exhibits; the tools
download public material from its original servers for local use.

Nothing in this project circumvents authentication, encryption or any other
technical protection measure.

